  "intro": "The Corp installed a piece of ice in front of R&D and will rez it when you approach. Palisade is a barrier, strength 2, with one subroutine: end the run. Cleaver has strength 3, so it can break that subroutine for 1 credit — no boost needed against a central server.\n\nThis lesson: run R&D, break Palisade, and access the top card.",
